# Any other old Squarespace condition URL falls back to the conditions index.
# NOTE: scoped to /blog/conditions/* on purpose. `/blog/*` and `/blog` used to
# be listed here too, but /blog is now a real section of this site and
# Cloudflare Pages evaluates _redirects BEFORE serving static assets - those two
# rules would 301 every blog post to /conditions. Never re-add them.
/blog/conditions/*  /conditions  301

